{
  "uid": "bench-infra",
  "title": "Infrastructure (all servers)",
  "description": "CPU, memory, disk and network for all three hosts, from the host-local agents \u2014 no inbound monitoring ports required.",
  "tags": [
    "benchmark",
    "infra"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Source and why there is no node_exporter here",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "CPU, memory, disk and network for **all three** hosts come from each machine's `bench-agent`, republished by the pipeline exporter as `bench_host_metric{role=...,metric=...}`.\n\nThere is deliberately no `node_exporter` on SERVER 2 or SERVER 3: that would require opening port 9100 inbound on each, and the agent already collects the same data at **1 s** \u2014 finer than this 15 s scrape. The full-resolution series lands in `results/<test-id>/raw/host-*.jsonl`, which is what the generated report actually reads.\n\nAll three are burstable **t3.large**. CPU credit exhaustion throttles the vCPU and is indistinguishable from a software regression on these graphs \u2014 check `CPUCreditBalance` before concluding anything from a late-run slowdown."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "CPU",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU utilisation",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "bench_host_metric{metric=\"cpu_percent\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1.5,
            "fillOpacity": 6,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisSoftMax": 100,
            "gradientMode": "opacity"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "generator"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#7a8fa6"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "collector"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#2f7d95"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "compactor"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#8a6fa8"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
